          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 tests: check that all chunks are compressed",
        "message": "LU-10026 tests: check that all chunks are compressed\n\nAdd sanity-compr test_2001, which streams a large sequential\nwrite to a compressed file and verifies from the client-side\ncompression stats that (nearly) every chunk was written\ncompressed, i.e. that the OSC forms full compressible chunks.\n\nThis exercises the can_merge_pages() behaviour that landed on\nmaster in commit 366fe06822 (\"LU-10026 osc: improve\ncan_merge_pages()\"): pages with different OBD_BRW_ASYNC /\nOBD_BRW_SOFT_SYNC hints must still merge into full chunks.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-11063\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <bzzz@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nWas-Change-Id: I6dd2643c93739fd6abaeb7add27f530a57fdcf64\nChange-Id: Ice73943d4a2c297c1a95e0754b75b1f157df6c6f\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
